        "question_VgCrmc": {
          "type": "question",
          "settings": {
            "default_open": false,
            "title": "Do you only work on one room?",
            "content": "<p>This package is scoped per room or zone, so the price stays predictable. If you would like us to design multiple rooms, please adjust the quantity and 'add to cart'. </p><p>For a multi-room scheme, also check out the Sourcing & Specification or Full Service packages which could give you better value. </p>",
